  this origin story and then you had this  version of Peter Parker who has been  spider-man for a really really long time  helping miles who has no idea how to be  spider-man and then you have the other  spider people come in from the other  multiverses and really bring the movie  together  you have spider-gwen who is one of my  personal favorite web-slinger's we had  spider-man you are who was a really good  character to have in there and he was  hilarious  you have penny Parker who was this sort  of animated girl in the movie which  added a completely different aspect to  it but again it really fit and the  dynamic between her character and the  rest of the spider people worked  extremely well and then you had spider  ham in there which was probably my least  favorite not that I didn't like him but  I just enjoyed the other spider people  much more than I did spider-ham but  there are many people that said that he  was hilarious and they loved him and  again they made him fit very well with  the rest of the group and the movie I  loved the character development of Miles  Morales and I loved that Peter Parker  was there to help him he doesn't just  jump right into being spider-man it  takes him some time to learn he freaks  out at first as anybody would if you got  bit by a radioactive spider and all of a  sudden had powers so he has to deal with  that and he has to deal with being in  middle school and he has to deal with  parents who loved him but smother him  about getting good grades so he has to  figure all of that out and then he asked  Peter Parker there to help him and then  he has the rest of the spider people  come in and they encourage him as well  and the fight scenes are really awesome  because you have a bunch of different  spider people fighting a bunch of  different villains I love how they  incorporated different villains you're  gonna have multiple spider people you  might as well have multiple different  villains it was almost like taking five  different action scenes from five  different movies and slamming them into  one and they did it in a really  brilliant way and to top it all off the  music was really really good it got me  super hyped up I've already downloaded  some of the songs that were in the movie  basically everything just worked  everything about the movie came together  the stories the animation the action the  character developments the character  interactions the music it all came  together for an overall amazing movie so  that's my non-spoiler review on  spider-man into the spider verse it hit  theaters last night on December 13th so  go check it out  and don't forget to subscribe like and  comment down below with your thoughts  and your favorite superhero so you can  enter the giveaway and stay up to date  on everything related to Marvel  spider-man into the spider-verse  and Avengers and game as always thank  you all so much for watching  woof woof  [Music]  you
 

